@startuml
title UML State Machine Diagram (Digidoclocker)

[*] --> Registration

state Registration
Registration : entry / Get the Registration Details

state UserType <<choice>>
UserType --> CitizenLogin : [Citizen]
UserType --> RegistrarRequest : [Registrar]

state CitizenLogin
CitizenLogin : entry / Enter Login Details

state CitizenActions
CitizenActions : entry / Upload Documents, View Profile, Apply for Certificate
CitizenActions --> CitizenActions : Continue Uploading Documents
CitizenActions --> [*] : AccessEnded

state RegistrarRequest
RegistrarRequest : entry / Request Certificates for Verification
RegistrarRequest --> RegistrarRequest : Continue Requesting More Certificates
RegistrarRequest --> [*] : AccessEnded

Registration --> CitizenLogin : LoginDetailsCorrect
Registration --> Registration : Register

[*] --> CitizenActions
[*] --> RegistrarRequest

@enduml
